cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite the repository and the original work acknowledged in the README."
type: software
title: "Weight Space: Direct Policy Weight Editing"
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - name: "Abhijit"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Abhijit-without-h/weight-space"
url: "https://github.com/Abhijit-without-h/weight-space"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  An independent experiment in compiling restricted teacher-derived spatial
  controllers directly into existing grid-game policy weights, without
  gradient training during editing. Includes four games, twelve existing
  checkpoints, a calibration gate, evaluation evidence, and reproducible analysis.
keywords:
  - weight editing
  - reinforcement learning
  - reproducibility
